{"id":"inmediatamente","lemma":"inmediatamente","pos":"adv","rank":929,"glosses":["immediately"],"ipa":"/immeˌdjataˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-inmediatamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Llama a Tom inmediatamente.","en":"Call Tom immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800777"},{"text":"Dije inmediatamente que sí.","en":"I said yes immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461977"},{"text":"Tenemos que empezar inmediatamente.","en":"We must start immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585876"},{"text":"Tienes que irte inmediatamente.","en":"You must leave immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611846"},{"text":"Tom inmediatamente se preocupó.","en":"Tom was immediately worried.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306312"}]}